<span class="cs-line hl-a">  Wan2.2-A14B:      38.3</span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># ── HUMAN EGOCENTRIC ───────────────────────────</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g">Human World Bench I2V</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g">  Cosmos3-Super:    71.9  ← SOTA (all models)</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g">  Veo-3.1†:         67.8</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g">  Wan2.2-A14B:      60.7</span>
